Package: PlayerPredictorMLB
Title: MLB Player Performance Prediction and Compadevtools::build_readme()rison
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anthony", "Yaghmour", , "Anthony.Yaghmour@Northwestern.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for analyzing Major League Baseball
    player performance using regular-season statistics from 2021 to 2026.
    The package includes tools for expected-statistic prediction, player-season
    similarity comparisons, and estimating monetary value based on Wins Above
    Replacement (WAR). Developed for the MSDS 457 graduate course at
    Northwestern University.
